* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.parquet binary

# Externally-published artifacts that are pinned by sha256 in
# data/reference/reference_manifest.json. Git must NOT normalise these.
# TLC serves taxi_zone_lookup.csv with CRLF line endings; under the `* text=auto
# eol=lf` rule above, git rewrites it on commit (observed 2026-08-17: 12,331
# bytes -> 12,065, sha256 1a99e105... -> 5e8f5ff1...), so a fresh clone's bytes
# would no longer match the pin the tests check. A pin and a normaliser are
# enemies; the pin wins, because it is the thing that says the upstream moved.
data/reference/** -text
